{'symbol': 'ALLE', 'date': '2022-04-26 05:30:00', 'title': 'ALLEGION REPORTS FIRST-QUARTER 2022 FINANCIAL RESULTS, RAISES FULL-YEAR 2022 REVENUE OUTLOOK, REAFFIRMS FULL-YEAR 2022 EPS OUTLOOK', 'text': 'DUBLIN--(BUSINESS WIRE)--ALLEGION PLC (NYSE: ALLE), A LEADING GLOBAL PROVIDER OF SECURITY PRODUCTS AND SOLUTIONS, TODAY REPORTED FIRST-QUARTER 2022 NET REVENUES OF $723.6 MILLION AND NET EARNINGS OF $93 MILLION, OR $1.05 PER SHARE. EXCLUDING CHARGES RELATED TO RESTRUCTURING, ACQUISITION AND INTEGRATION EXPENSES, AS WELL AS A NON-OPERATING INVESTMENT GAIN, ADJUSTED NET EARNINGS WERE $95.2 MILLION, OR $1.07 PER SHARE, DOWN 10.8 PERCENT WHEN COMPARED WITH FIRST-QUARTER 2021 ADJUSTED EPS OF $1.20.'}